  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nImmerse yourself in the bold lines and timeless motifs at Yanki Tattoo Studio, where traditional and sketch-style tattoos come to life in the hands of masterful artists in the heart of Moscow, Russia. Experience a studio where the legacy of Moscow tattooing is respected, while personalized visions are intricately inked, creating unique stories on skin. To begin your artistic journey with Yanki, contact them at yankiworkshop@gmail.com or peruse their inspiring works at @workshopyanki.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Moscow, Central Federal District, Russia"
